Package: likRatioPlot
Title: Visualization of Effect of Uncertainty in Prior odds and Likelihood Ratio on Posterior Odds
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jordan", "Rodu", , "jordan.rodu@virginia.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package allows users to create a plot describing the effects of uncertainty in the
    prior odds and likelihood ratio on the posterior odds.  A shaded trapezoid describes the uncertainty
    area, and dashed lines project the bounds of the trapezoid to the prior odds and posterior odds axes.
    The uncertainty trapezoid can be directly compared to a posterior odds of 1.
